# ER (exact resume P0, docs/tp4-exact-resume.md 5.2): a committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a
# throwaway commit of tp4/exact-resume and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job). Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is the PLACEHOLDER every fusion package names: replace it with the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env), and in SP0 alone with tp4-fusion-6 (or tp4-oneq-1), which needs no build. The twins (-fx-all-er, -fx-all-er-audit) are
# placed in qwen_c2_profiles.json by WP0 from scripts/ci/fusion-wp/ER.json (make_fusion_profiles.py --write); until then the templates naming them do not pass c2_serving_job.py's profile check.
# The cards serve production: the owner stops the node agent and unserves production BEFORE X0 and restores it after Z (the cutover pack's steps and post-checks); nothing here does either.
# ERA (STOP; the AUDITED ATTACH): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-er-audit = the combined audited arm (every fx-all lever with its audit) plus QWEN_PREFIX_STICKY_UNDROP=1,
# QWEN_PREFIX_WINDOW_CARRY=1, QWEN_PREFIX_WINDOW_CARRY_AUDIT=1, on eight live seats and the 32k code prompts (unsalted: the graft's switches change nothing for them, so this is also the no-regression
# boot). READ: c2_smoke_check clean under every fx-all lever's rule AND exact_resume_smoke (the line '[PINDIAG] prefix: window carry engaged undrop=1 carry=1 audit=1 ...', the sticky install line
# unchanged 'install sticky=1 lookahead=16 drop_last=True', no window carry audit line with exact=False), every answer complete, no stall. Duration (estimate): 45 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-er-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k
